M1P=["Foundation establishes the behavioural basis of strategy: how human judgement, bias and emotional climate shape the decisions an executive team makes. It prepares each participant and group for the Direction, Influence and Grounding modules that follow.",
"Unit 1 — Behavioural Strategy Fundamentals is the single unit of this module. Its Problem Charter sets up the simulated company your group leads through every later unit."]
M1F=[M1P[0],"Unit 1 — Behavioural Strategy Fundamentals is the single unit of this module. Its Problem Charter sets up the simulated company each group leads through every later unit."]
M2a="Direction establishes the strategic intent, measurable outcomes and integrity checks that give the enterprise a coherent path to results. It considers how the strategy is defined, how success is made measurable, and whether the direction holds before execution begins."
M2b="The Direction learning journey progresses from Unit 2 — Strategy Visioning &amp; Success in Practice (SiP) (strategic intent and success), to Unit 3 — SiP KISS Mapping &amp; OKR Definition (measurable outcomes), and then to Unit 4 — Direction Integrity (ABCV-MBT) (integrity of direction)."
M2b4="The Direction learning journey progresses from Unit 2 — Strategy Visioning &amp; Success in Practice (SiP) (strategic intent and success), to Unit 3 — SiP KISS Mapping &amp; OKR Definition (measurable outcomes), and then to this unit, which tests the integrity of that direction before execution."
M3a="Influence mobilises the people and performance systems through which strategy is carried into execution. It considers how leaders build shared understanding and commitment, establish and measure performance, and clear the blockages that slow delivery."
M3b="The Influence learning journey progresses from Unit 5 — Aligning Heart &amp; Mind (people alignment), to Unit 6 — Performance Management Setup (performance architecture), Unit 7 — Establishing Performance Expectations (owned commitments), Unit 8 — Performance Measurement (review discipline), and then to Unit 9 — Strategic Unclogging (flow of execution)."
M3b9=M3b.replace("and then to Unit 9 — Strategic Unclogging (flow of execution).","and then to this unit, which restores the flow of execution.")
MLO={1:["Strengthen the objectivity of strategic decisions by recognising how human judgement and organisational dynamics shape them.","Cultivate a decision climate in which leaders examine evidence and assumptions before committing to strategic choices.","Lead collective decision-making that converts diverse executive perspectives into sound enterprise judgement."],
2:["Shape a coherent strategic direction that unites leadership around a shared ambition and a clear picture of success.","Translate strategic ambition into enterprise priorities and measurable outcomes that make progress visible.","Safeguard the integrity of strategic direction by testing it against customer reality, critical assumptions and competitive conditions before resources are committed.","Align executive decisions and accountability with the agreed strategic direction across the enterprise."],
3:["Build shared strategic understanding and commitment that carry strategy from intention into coordinated action.","Establish performance arrangements that connect enterprise results to owned individual contributions and enabling organisational conditions.","Sustain execution momentum by interpreting performance evidence and acting on it with balanced executive judgement.","Restore the flow of strategy execution by resolving the people and organisational constraints that impede delivery."]}
